  "limitations": [
    "Point-in-time measurements from one Server Two network vantage are not universal provider guarantees.",
    "RTDS activity does not declare a pending or confirmed lifecycle stage and is used only as a public arrival baseline.",
    "The Struct and RTDS scored windows are non-overlapping and their latency samples are never pooled.",
    "Confirmed chain logs cannot enumerate pending transactions that never reach the chain.",
    "The benchmark measures subscriber-visible delivery and does not identify any provider's private implementation."
  ],
